// # crypto — Symmetric + AEAD + Hash
//
// Logline: The classical crypto primitives — MD5, SHA-1, SHA-2, SHA-3, HMAC, AES, AEAD (AES-GCM, chacha20-poly1305), and the dudect constant-time test harness.
