// Setup: crypto.c is the core (md5, sha1, sha2, hmac); aead.c is the AEAD seal/open; sha3.c is SHA-3; hash.c is the misc-hash family. The dudect test util lives in qa/ (moved there in a follow-up).
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read crypto.c — the core (md5, sha1, sha2, hmac_sha256, sha512).
//   2. Read aead.c — AES-GCM + chacha20-poly1305 seal/open.
//   3. Read sha3.c — SHA-3-256.
//   4. Read hash.c — the misc-hash family.
//
// ──▓▓ crypto ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: constant-time primitives + dudect validation ::
